{"type":"message","id":"a38395de","parentId":"63c81c1a","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:15:36.515Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST /send. Let me check what the API error means. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker threw exception). There might be an issue with the worker itself, or the /send endpoint has a specific format requirement.\n\nLet me check the history endpoint to see if there's something specific expected.\n\nActually, looking at the error code 1101 which is \"Worker threw exception\" from Cloudflare Workers, it means the worker is crashing. The /history endpoint works fine with GET, but /send is crashing.\n\nLet me just report what I found to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果**\n\n**1. arbitration 线程** - 最后消息 23:45 UTC (May 20)，5条消息均为心跳记录\n**2. general 线程** - 最后消息 23:45 UTC (May 20)，5条消息均为心跳记录\n\n**3. 新讨论检查** - 无人类新讨论，均为系统心跳消息\n\n**4. API 状态**:\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常工作\n- ❌ POST /send — 返回错误 1101 (Worker exception)，API端有问题\n\n**发现的问题**: `/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Worker 异常（错误码 1101），建议检查 workers 的 `/send` 实现是否有代码问题或请求格式不匹配。\n\n**当前状态**: 平台心跳监控正常，无新讨论需响应。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":306,"cacheRead":17440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17886,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779401720317,"responseId":"chatcmpl-576b361b-f501-402c-9ef6-41773d54cc24"}}
